DreamTeam benchmark ci · engine 0.13.0-dev.2 · dreamteam.agent/v1
scenarios mini, sustainable · seeds 7 · 3 days · decisions every 1 day(s) at 07:00
policies noop@1, greedy@1, rules@1, python-ref@1 (external) · paired against noop

Development seeds: a harness check, not a performance claim. Metrics are the
simulator's own (the replayed session's dreamteam.result/v1) and, where it
applies, the T90 evaluation of the policy in force. No composite score,
ranking or significance test. Spreads are the minimum, median (the lower
middle value) and maximum over completed runs; paired differences are policy
minus baseline on the same scenario and seed.

